--- all 256 values of UInt8 and a NULL: nothing is left for the _FillValue
1
--- 255 values of UInt8 and a NULL: the missing value becomes the _FillValue
256	1	0	254
--- a Nullable column of all 256 values but no NULL: written without the attribute
256	0	0	255
--- a wider type always has a value to spare
257	1
